<title>JAPAN: Japan Storage - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Storage - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 52.27		vs	   46.32</p>
<p> Operating	    2.07		vs	    1.72</p>
<p> Current		1.23		vs	  777    mln</p>
<p> Net		  513    mln	  vs	  338    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    2.88 yen	  vs	    1.90 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    178 million	  vs	 178 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Storage Battery Co Ltd makes storage batteries and is affiliated with the Mitsubishi group.</p>
